# Slice 293 (FORMAL-DEFAULT; docs/LMX_semantics.ru.md :467 "Нет ни аргумента, ни допустимого дефолта — обычный отказ
# вызова"): a call that names the formal with a default and omits the one without is refused at translation.
fn: e (int: x; int: y 7) int
    return: x * 10 + y
end: e
int: code 7
if: e(y := 3) != 3
    code: 81
---
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: code; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
